  </div>
</div>
<p>By ensuring these four documents—self‑attested RC photocopy, current PUC, valid insurance certificate, and IBA‑approved consignment bilty—are ready and correctly notarized, you safeguard your vehicle, comply with legal requirements, and pave the way for a hassle‑free transportation experience in Khadda Kushinagar.</p></div>
